{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫劇《璀璨之城》昨晚（26日）第11集劇情相當炸裂，尤其張智霖邊清唱《Que Será, Será》邊慢條斯理弑父一幕，令網民嗌心寒！</p><p>昨晚劇情講述官志琛（姜大衞飾）出意外後，官家權鬥進入白熱化，孝賢（張智霖飾）於重要關頭竟獲持久授權、並從孝君（吳卓羲飾）手上奪回尚利鋒掌控權。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T11:42:43.705376+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T11:17:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T02:18:18.848003+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T11:38:18.238147+00:00","content_hash":"ae73fa3a53c60d9de73553605bd753283fd43baa2c5931fd8742eaf2be47017f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}